 "strings": {
  "I'm the only one who can save this\nignorant, backwoods land, and that's that!": "",
  "and lived in Kyo,": "",
  "Everyone makes mistakes.": "",
  "Get down and beg\nand I just might spare your life.": "",
  "The British fleet will be knocking down\nyour door any minute now!": "",
  "Looking at it that way,": "",
  "It's in the hands of so many others\nwe've never known.": "",
  "From now on, it's me above the masses.": "",
  "The hell are you doing, Ryoma!?": "",
  "Your <i>what</i>?": "",
  "What's the plan, then?": "",
  "at least for me,": "",
  "Yet here I am.": "",
  "You see... from about the time you\njoined the Shinsengumi...": "",
  "and frankly, I don't care.": "",
  "It doesn't matter where I go,": "",
  "I tried to lead this country through brute force.": "",
  "I'd already lost.": "",
  "So, it's our job...": "",
  "It's our duty to make sure\nthey know the score.": "",
  "Kill me. Take back your name\nand live as Sakamoto Ryoma!": "",
  "Huh, Brother?": "",
  "Remember what you said, Brother?": "",
  "You and me, we've both died once already.": "",
  "Brother!?": "",
  "This whole thing": "",
  "and that's when I finally understood...": "",
  "Damned monster...": "",
  "Like there's a difference.": "",
  "We'll still keep our shape as a nation.": "",
  "For one's country.": "",
  "I'm taking this place apart.": "",
  "Sakamoto Ryoma's gone.": "",
  "and Sakamoto Ryoma at Omiya.": "",
  "Whose faces we've never seen.": "",
  "Sun's coming up.": "",
  "And what's that?": "",
  "Imperial rule? Can't say\nwe anticipated that one.": "",
  "Do you really think you stand even\nthe slightest chance against them!?": "",
  "No?": "",
  "Don't worry...": "",
  "Yo...do...": "",
  "Yodo-san.": "",
  "Yodo's been the one calling all the shots.": "",
  "and I won't let Yamauchi Yodo\nget his hands on it.": "",
  "Yamauchi Yodo...": "",
  "You want to replace the Emperor!\nThat's the plan, right!?": "",
  "The rest of you can rot.": "",
  "A man who would be willing to give\nJapan up, while keeping it in its place.": "",
  "No sense fightin' it.": "",
  "When will you learn!?": "",
  "Love.": "",
  "For love.": "",
  "Somewhere deep down.": "",
  "but only those who respond with love\ncan truly change things. Of that, I'm certain.　": "",
  "We don't need to hate each other anymore.": "",
  "The new Kyo government will have\nno choice but to sit and watch,": "",
  "I told you before, I'm not selling it.": "",
  "End it, Ryoma!": "",
  "To all my brothers in Japan...": "",
  "We can watch the new dawn in the next life,": "",
  "and Japan? Well, it will\nbecome a British colony.": "",
  "but Japan will rise up again and again.": "",
  "Changing the times requires more.": "",
  "Why we call this place home.": "",
  "Like with Katsura.　": "",
  "my brother, Takechi...": "",
  "Oh, Takechi...": "",
  "Takechi Hanpeita...": "",
  "Takechi Hanpeita.": "",
  "Takechi Hanpeita in Tosa,": "",
  "This is where you die.": "",
  "I won't be able to face Pops otherwise.": "",
  "You think so?": "",
  "They know what spilled blood\nis actually worth.": "",
  "It'll take a lot more than that.": "",
  "We wouldn't send you off alone.": "",
  "to make this place the best it can be.": "",
  "Your country should be a place\nthat makes you happy to be alive!": "",
  "This is how they lived.": "",
  "They know.": "",
  "I couldn't care less.": "",
  "But I don't know him.": "",
  "and no wit or tactic could ever compare.": "",
  "No, we'll all accompany you to hell.": "",
  "Still, the results were just sublime.": "",
  "They sought out Japanese citizens\nwho could maximize their interests in secret.": "",
  "I can only protect the world within my reach.": "",
  "There's no reason for it.": "",
  "Just let me go!": "",
  "How Pops felt?": "",
  "I think I know exactly how Pops felt.": "",
  "is that I've got you and Pops.": "",
  "That all you have to say?": "",
  "You said it yourself.": "",
  "That's what you said, right?": "",
  "You make it sound so vulgar, Takechi.": "",
  "If not, what future do we have?": "",
  "As if anyone asked.": "",
  "Who are you!?": "",
  "Who are you talking to?": "",
  "Anyone can see you're sealing your own doom!": "",
  "Bastard.": "",
  "Very soon, we'll be inviting\nthe British fleet into Tosa.": "",
  "He died at Omiya.": "",
  "Kondo, Katsura, Saigo,": "",
  "We have to keep going.": "",
  "We have to keep moving forward.": "",
  "Isolation doesn't work!": "",
  "And we'll keep on making them.": "",
  "All the men who fought...": "",
  "Maybe I'll make you one of my puppets.": "",
  "Something far more important\nthan cunning or ruthlessness.": "",
  "I chose to walk a path of cruelty.": "",
  "Please! Spare me!": "",
  "Fool them how?　": "",
  "Ryoma...　": "",
  "A year ago, before you fled Tosa,": "",
  "[\"Sakamoto Ryoma\"\nby Sakazaki Shinran]": "",
  "Oh, yeah.": "",
  "Yeah, and I'm not the only one.": "",
  "Things have been pretty tight since\nyou quit as President of Domestic Affairs.": "",
  "Take you...": "",
  "You, along with Sakamoto Ryoma, more or\nless brought us the Meiji Restoration.": "",
  "but not many people get to adopt a life or two.": "",
  "Lot happened once Sakamoto Ryoma passed.": "",
  "Right, so you take it out on me again?": "",
  "My, my, sensei, don't tell me\nit's another failure?": "",
  "no matter how many other\npeople's lives you live,": "",
  "You can only write so much\nfor so long, you know.": "",
  "Mhm.": "",
  "Sure did.": "",
  "I wanna be just like you, Dad.": "",
  "Dad, did you carve your own path?": "",
  "I'm sure those two": "",
  "For one thing, I'm just about up to my neck\nin paperwork. And then some.": "",
  "This whole country did.": "",
  "will find this sky more beautiful\nthan anyone else out there.": "",
  "I hope we get more of this.\nMore time together. More of these views.": "",
  "It's been a year since you retired.": "",
  "We will.": "",
  "They said they were heading\nthat way, didn't they?": "",
  "Oh, right.": "",
  "When time comes, always\nput your best foot forward.": "",
  "But, listen. There will come a time when you\ndecide to carve your own path in life.": "",
  "Does that sound familiar to you?": "",
  "Hey, kiddo.": "",
  "I haven't had much chance to stop by.": "",
  "So you've got some thinking to do.": "",
  "Hey, that's bright.": "",
  "We all followed his example.\nAnd thanks to him, we made it through.": "",
  "I guess you don't need to drag\nthat name around anymore, do you?": "",
  "A new day has already dawned for Japan.": "",
  "Say all you want, but there's\nnothing I can do about it.": "",
  "Delicate things like this take finesse.": "",
  "TWO YEARS LATER,\nHAKOZAKI, TOKYO": "",
  "Makes me wonder,": "",
  "Living the lush life, I see.": "",
  "Do you understand?": "",
  "Okay, tell you what. You can be\nlike me as much as you want.": "",
  "Well, no.": "",
  "And be it name or position,": "",
  "Someone tells me they want\nto write Sakamoto-han's story.": "",
  "You all right?": "",
  "Then they ask if they can stay\nhere at Teradaya for free.": "",
  "What do you want to be when you grow up?": "",
  "Yamauchi Yodo-sensei.": "",
  "but at least they can make\nsome memories together.": "",
  "And you even guided Japan's rebirth\nfrom behind the scenes.": "",
  "I'm glad, but have you really thought about it?": "",
  "Takechi-san.": "",
  "I mean, I went from Niibori to Katsura\nto Kido, hardly skipping a beat,": "",
  "They can't exactly get married,": "",
  "It's a beautiful day today...": "",
  "It's beautiful.": "",
  "You stopped Tosa from\nbecoming an all-out fortress.": "",
  "your love for sake always stays the same.": "",
  "You open up the window\nlike that, I can't focus.": "",
  "you think it's the same over in Aso?": "",
  "I'm trying to combine two lives into one here.": ""
 },
 "ref_ja": {
  "I'm the only one who can save this\nignorant, backwoods land, and that's that!": "世間知らずの日本を\n救えるのはワシだけだ！！",
  "and lived in Kyo,": "京で生き",
  "Everyone makes mistakes.": "人間ってのは間違う",
  "Get down and beg\nand I just might spare your life.": "今　土下座して請えば命は助けてやろう",
  "The British fleet will be knocking down\nyour door any minute now!": "今　目の前に\nイギリスの艦隊が迫っているんだぞ！？",
  "Looking at it that way,": "今となっちゃ",
  "It's in the hands of so many others\nwe've never known.": "今はまだ顔も見たこともねえ",
  "From now on, it's me above the masses.": "今後　この国ではワシ以外の万民は",
  "The hell are you doing, Ryoma!?": "何してるんだ龍馬",
  "Your <i>what</i>?": "何だと？",
  "What's the plan, then?": "何をする気だ",
  "at least for me,": "俺にとっては",
  "Yet here I am.": "俺の心は揺れた",
  "You see... from about the time you\njoined the Shinsengumi...": "俺はお前が新選組に入った頃から",
  "and frankly, I don't care.": "俺はどうでもいい",
  "It doesn't matter where I go,": "俺はどこまで行っても",
  "I tried to lead this country through brute force.": "俺は力でこの国を変えようとした",
  "I'd already lost.": "俺は負けていたんだ",
  "So, it's our job...": "俺らの仕事は",
  "It's our duty to make sure\nthey know the score.": "俺らは兄弟たちに伝えなきゃならねえんだ",
  "Kill me. Take back your name\nand live as Sakamoto Ryoma!": "俺を斬って\n坂本龍馬という名を取り戻すんだ！",
  "Huh, Brother?": "兄弟",
  "Remember what you said, Brother?": "兄弟の言うとおりさ",
  "You and me, we've both died once already.": "兄弟も俺も　一度死んだ",
  "Brother!?": "兄弟！？",
  "This whole thing": "全ては",
  "and that's when I finally understood...": "初めて分かった",
  "Damned monster...": "化け物が……！",
  "Like there's a difference.": "同じことだ",
  "We'll still keep our shape as a nation.": "国としての体は守ったままでな",
  "For one's country.": "国のため",
  "I'm taking this place apart.": "土佐をぶっ壊すんだよ",
  "Sakamoto Ryoma's gone.": "坂本龍馬は",
  "and Sakamoto Ryoma at Omiya.": "坂本龍馬は　近江屋で死んだんだ",
  "Whose faces we've never seen.": "声を聞いたこともねえ兄弟たちが",
  "Sun's coming up.": "夜が明けるな",
  "And what's that?": "大事なもん？",
  "Imperial rule? Can't say\nwe anticipated that one.": "大政奉還\nあれは想定外のことだったが",
  "Do you really think you stand even\nthe slightest chance against them!?": "奴らとまともに闘って\n勝てるとでも思っているのか！？",
  "No?": "嫌か",
  "Don't worry...": "安心しろ",
  "Yo...do...": "容堂……！",
  "Yodo-san.": "容堂さん",
  "Yodo's been the one calling all the shots.": "容堂に使われるようになっていた",
  "and I won't let Yamauchi Yodo\nget his hands on it.": "山内容堂の手に渡す前にな",
  "Yamauchi Yodo...": "山内容堂は",
  "You want to replace the Emperor!\nThat's the plan, right!?": "帝になって代わる　そういうことだろ！",
  "The rest of you can rot.": "平等にクズとなる",
  "A man who would be willing to give\nJapan up, while keeping it in its place.": "強い権力を持ちながら\n国を売ることをも厭わない人間を",
  "No sense fightin' it.": "往生せえや",
  "When will you learn!?": "往生際が悪いぞ！！",
  "Love.": "愛さ",
  "For love.": "愛のため",
  "Somewhere deep down.": "愛はあるさ",
  "but only those who respond with love\ncan truly change things. Of that, I'm certain.　": "愛を最後まで捨てなかった人間だけが\n世界を変える　",
  "We don't need to hate each other anymore.": "憎しみ合う必要もないんだ",
  "The new Kyo government will have\nno choice but to sit and watch,": "成立したての京の新政権になす術はない",
  "I told you before, I'm not selling it.": "教えただろう　売るのではない",
  "End it, Ryoma!": "斬れ龍馬！",
  "To all my brothers in Japan...": "日本の兄弟たちよ",
  "We can watch the new dawn in the next life,": "日本の夜明けを見ようじゃねえか",
  "and Japan? Well, it will\nbecome a British colony.": "日本は\nイギリスの植民地となろう",
  "but Japan will rise up again and again.": "日本は何度でも立ち上がるさ",
  "Changing the times requires more.": "時代を変えるには",
  "Why we call this place home.": "本当に必要なもんを",
  "Like with Katsura.　": "桂に　",
  "my brother, Takechi...": "武市の兄弟",
  "Oh, Takechi...": "武市よ",
  "Takechi Hanpeita...": "武市半平太",
  "Takechi Hanpeita.": "武市半平太",
  "Takechi Hanpeita in Tosa,": "武市半平太は土佐で",
  "This is where you die.": "死を与えてやろう",
  "I won't be able to face Pops otherwise.": "死んだ親っさんに顔向けできねぇからな",
  "You think so?": "そ、そうか？",
  "They know what spilled blood\nis actually worth.": "流れた血の先に\n何があるのかを知っている",
  "It'll take a lot more than that.": "滅びる国じゃねえ",
  "We wouldn't send you off alone.": "独りで逝けとは言わない",
  "to make this place the best it can be.": "生きていける世の中を作ることじゃねえ",
  "Your country should be a place\nthat makes you happy to be alive!": "生きていてよかったと思える\n国を作ることなんじゃねえのか！",
  "This is how they lived.": "生き様だ",
  "They know.": "皆",
  "I couldn't care less.": "知ったこっちゃねえ",
  "But I don't know him.": "知らねえな",
  "and no wit or tactic could ever compare.": "知恵や策略は通用しない",
  "No, we'll all accompany you to hell.": "私たちも地獄までお供しよう",
  "Still, the results were just sublime.": "結果的には非常に助かった",
  "They sought out Japanese citizens\nwho could maximize their interests in secret.": "自分たちの利権を最大限引き出せる日本人を\nひそかに捜していた",
  "I can only protect the world within my reach.": "自分の手が届く世界しか守れねえ",
  "There's no reason for it.": "血を流す必要はねえ",
  "Just let me go!": "見逃してくれ！！",
  "How Pops felt?": "親っさんの",
  "I think I know exactly how Pops felt.": "親っさんの気持ちが痛いほどわかる",
  "is that I've got you and Pops.": "親っさんや兄弟が大切なんだ",
  "That all you have to say?": "言いたい事はそれだけか",
  "You said it yourself.": "言ったじゃないか",
  "That's what you said, right?": "言ってくれてたんだろ？",
  "You make it sound so vulgar, Takechi.": "言葉が汚いぞ武市",
  "If not, what future do we have?": "託すべき未来もなくなっちまう",
  "As if anyone asked.": "誰がてめえに",
  "Who are you!?": "誰だ　貴様！？",
  "Who are you talking to?": "誰だそれは",
  "Anyone can see you're sealing your own doom!": "負けるのは目に見えているんだぞ！！",
  "Bastard.": "貴様",
  "Very soon, we'll be inviting\nthe British fleet into Tosa.": "近くイギリス艦隊を\nこの土佐に招き入れる手はずだ",
  "He died at Omiya.": "近江屋で死んだと",
  "Kondo, Katsura, Saigo,": "近藤や桂に西郷",
  "We have to keep going.": "進まなきゃならねえんだよ",
  "We have to keep moving forward.": "進むことを止めちまったら",
  "Isolation doesn't work!": "鎖国で弱りきった",
  "And we'll keep on making them.": "間違ってばかりだ",
  "All the men who fought...": "闘った男たちの",
  "Maybe I'll make you one of my puppets.": "雑兵の一人くらいにはしてやるぞ",
  "Something far more important\nthan cunning or ruthlessness.": "非情さよりも\nもっと大事なもんがあったってことさ",
  "I chose to walk a path of cruelty.": "非情な道を選んだはずの",
  "Please! Spare me!": "頼む！　た　助けてくれ！！",
  "Fool them how?　": "騙すだと？　",
  "Ryoma...　": "龍馬　",
  "A year ago, before you fled Tosa,": "１年前　土佐を抜ける時",
  "[\"Sakamoto Ryoma\"\nby Sakazaki Shinran]": "“坂崎紫瀾「坂本龍馬」”",
  "Oh, yeah.": "あぁ",
  "Yeah, and I'm not the only one.": "ああ　お父さんだけじゃない",
  "Things have been pretty tight since\nyou quit as President of Domestic Affairs.": "あなたが内国事務総裁を\n辞任されてからというもの……",
  "Take you...": "あなたは",
  "You, along with Sakamoto Ryoma, more or\nless brought us the Meiji Restoration.": "あなたは　坂本龍馬と並ぶ\n明治維新の功労者です",
  "but not many people get to adopt a life or two.": "あなたほど\n他人の人生を生きた人はいないでしょう",
  "Lot happened once Sakamoto Ryoma passed.": "あの坂本龍馬が果てた後",
  "Right, so you take it out on me again?": "あら　また八つ当たりどすか？",
  "My, my, sensei, don't tell me\nit's another failure?": "あーら　先生また失敗どすか？",
  "no matter how many other\npeople's lives you live,": "いくら他人の人生を生きようと",
  "You can only write so much\nfor so long, you know.": "いつになったら書き終わることやら",
  "Mhm.": "うん",
  "Sure did.": "ええ",
  "I wanna be just like you, Dad.": "お父さんのやってる仕事とかかなあ",
  "Dad, did you carve your own path?": "お父さんも昔そうしたの？",
  "I'm sure those two": "きっとあの２人には",
  "For one thing, I'm just about up to my neck\nin paperwork. And then some.": "こっちは　政府の仕事を山ほど押し付けられて\nてんやわんやでね",
  "This whole country did.": "この国の人間は",
  "will find this sky more beautiful\nthan anyone else out there.": "この空が\n誰よりも綺麗に見えるんやろうねぇ",
  "I hope we get more of this.\nMore time together. More of these views.": "これからウチら　どれだけ一緒の景色\n見られるんやろ",
  "It's been a year since you retired.": "ご隠居されてから１年",
  "We will.": "ずっとさ",
  "They said they were heading\nthat way, didn't they?": "そういや行ってんだっけか\nあいつらが",
  "Oh, right.": "そうでした",
  "When time comes, always\nput your best foot forward.": "その時は　迷わずその道を進め",
  "But, listen. There will come a time when you\ndecide to carve your own path in life.": "でもいつか　自分のやりたいこと\n自分の進むべき道がわかる日が来る",
  "Does that sound familiar to you?": "どこの誰だったか",
  "Hey, kiddo.": "なあ　お前",
  "I haven't had much chance to stop by.": "なかなか　挨拶に伺えませんでした",
  "So you've got some thinking to do.": "まだ分からないか",
  "Hey, that's bright.": "まぶしいなあ",
  "We all followed his example.\nAnd thanks to him, we made it through.": "みんなあの人の背中に導かれて\n強く生きてきたんだからな",
  "I guess you don't need to drag\nthat name around anymore, do you?": "もうその名を騙る必要もないんでしたよね？",
  "A new day has already dawned for Japan.": "もう日本の夜は明けたんだ",
  "Say all you want, but there's\nnothing I can do about it.": "んなこと言ったってしゃあないだろ",
  "Delicate things like this take finesse.": "上手く綺麗に繋げろっつー方が難しいや",
  "TWO YEARS LATER,\nHAKOZAKI, TOKYO": "二年後　東京箱崎",
  "Makes me wonder,": "今頃",
  "Living the lush life, I see.": "優雅なものですな",
  "Do you understand?": "分かったか？",
  "Okay, tell you what. You can be\nlike me as much as you want.": "分からないうちは\n俺の背中を見てついてこい",
  "Well, no.": "分かんない",
  "And be it name or position,": "名を変え　立場を変え",
  "Someone tells me they want\nto write Sakamoto-han's story.": "坂本はんの話を書きたいから",
  "You all right?": "大丈夫か？",
  "Then they ask if they can stay\nhere at Teradaya for free.": "寺田屋の部屋をタダで貸せ言わはったのは",
  "What do you want to be when you grow up?": "将来やりたいことはあるのか？",
  "Yamauchi Yodo-sensei.": "山内容堂先生",
  "but at least they can make\nsome memories together.": "想い出だけは作りに行こうってなぁ",
  "And you even guided Japan's rebirth\nfrom behind the scenes.": "日本の新しい国造りを陰で支えてくれた",
  "I'm glad, but have you really thought about it?": "本当にそれがお前のやりたいことなのか？",
  "Takechi-san.": "武市さん",
  "I mean, I went from Niibori to Katsura\nto Kido, hardly skipping a beat,": "私も新堀に桂　木戸と\n名前をコロコロ変えてきましたけど",
  "They can't exactly get married,": "結婚できひん代わりに",
  "It's a beautiful day today...": "綺麗な日本晴れやねえ",
  "It's beautiful.": "綺麗やね",
